sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>User: Open league dashboard
    User->>API: POST /api/graphql with query and variables
    API->>API: Validate query and field permissions
    API->>DB: Read requested teams, players and records
    DB-->>API: League data
    API-->>User: 200 OK with GraphQL data
    User->>User: Display dashboard
